    "body": "<!-- issue-sweep: DONE -->\nIssue sweep: already done on main: 96afea412, 4fbd4922a, 83c53732b (PR #2748).\n\n- No directory part from the status line reaches the shared report: `debug_info::shared_report` (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/debug_info.rs`) calls `report_scrub::scrub_paths` (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/report_scrub.rs`), and `report_scrub::tests::scrub_paths_keeps_only_the_file_name_of_each_path` pins it.\n- Tests pin non-project and export paths in user directories: `report_tests::the_report_door_scrubs_a_status_path_that_is_not_the_project` (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/report_tests.rs`) checks the full URL, and `report_scrub::tests::scrub_paths_keeps_only_the_file_name_of_each_path` checks exported `.nc` and `.json` paths.\n",
